    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1228 2310 1892">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1228 1026 1271" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: slateblue">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1228 277 1271">1.</dg:chunk> Financial and Operational Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1327 2310 1367; 1 240 1386 2310 1426; 1 240 1446 2310 1485; 1 240 1505 1857 1545">During the third quarter of 2146, the Adiri Fuel Reserves facility operated in complete compliance with all covenants and technical metrics detailed in the Secured Credit Agreement (Document 4A). The depot's containment systems maintained high thermodynamic efficiency, achieving a quarterly average Cryo-Storage Pressure Tolerance Index (CSPTI) of <docset:CurrentPeriodValue xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="96.2" dg:origin="1 438 1505 562 1545">96.2%</docset:CurrentPeriodValue>, which exceeds the <docset:CovenantCompliance xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="93.0" dg:origin="1 909 1505 1021 1545">93.0%</docset:CovenantCompliance> covenant standard specified in Section 4.01(1).</dg:chunk>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1615 2310 1654; 1 240 1674 2310 1713; 1 240 1733 2310 1773; 1 240 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 1195 1892" xml:id="operationalnarrative" dg:itemprop="references" dg:href="#annualcommodityyield" dg:value="Section 4.01(2)">Deuterium recovery volumes averaged <docset:ProjectedCommodityYield dg:origin="1 969 1615 1258 1654">1,285 kilograms</docset:ProjectedCommodityYield> of high-purity isotopic deuterium per Titan sidereal day, meeting the Deuterium Extraction Yield Target of <docset:AnnualCommodityYield dg:origin="1 1185 1674 1469 1713" xml:id="annualcommodityyield">1,200 kilograms</docset:AnnualCommodityYield> outlined in Section 4.01(2). Consequently, the Facility Loans accrued interest at the baseline interest rate of <docset:DiscountRate dg:origin="1 1346 1733 1907 1773" dg:style="font-weight: bold">TIDOR plus 5.75% per annum</docset:DiscountRate>, with no triggers of the Pressure Containment Risk Premium. In addition, the Helium-Boiloff Sinking Reserve balance was fully maintained at the required <docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve dg:origin="1 507 1852 793 1892" xml:id="restrictedescrowreserve">SC 300,000,000</docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve> under Section 4.01(3).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
